                   'People may speak of the mountain not only as a geographical landmark but as a place '
                   'with spiritual meaning. The stories can influence the language of prayers, the way '
                   'elders describe a landscape and the care shown toward particular places. Because '
                   'the precise identity of the Jomo in this project is not specified, this entry does '
